# A fillet's edges at radii of their own (an extension): two top edges
# of the extrusion of path_extrude that don't meet, picked and rounded
# by New Group > Fillet Edges; the second edge's [own radius] link takes
# a radius for it alone, here 3, which the screen lists under it with a
# link back to the fillet's; Check Solid finds it sound.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
click-entity 80030004
click-entity 80030016
menu Features|Fillet Edges
dump
twmove 105 225
twdown L 105 225
twup L 105 225
edit 3
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
